WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.260
Hey, did you see this?

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.370
Your fortune this week says that
you'll be able to go out

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:10.140
with a guy that everyone wants!

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:11.130
Oh.

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:12.610
You're not interested?

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:14.440
It's not that I'm not. but...

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.070
Oh my.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:20.180
A maiden always has to be
in love or it's the end. Yukimura-san.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:23.680
At this rate. it seems that I'll
be the first to find a boyfriend.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:28.760
A-A bone is stuck in my throat...

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.930
H-Here. have some of
my konnyaku!

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.130
S-Swallow it down quickly!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.530
Is she going to be all right?

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.720
Tokine, you really have to start worrying
about yourself before others.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:40.630
A boyfriend, huh?

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:53.780
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.650
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:55.650 --> 00:01:00.860
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.760
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:06.190
Drive away all hesitation

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:10.600
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:14.140
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.470
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:23.140
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:27.640
Sha la la la la...

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:34.060
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:36.020
(Secret romance)

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:41.230
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:42.990
(A strange distance)

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:49.840
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:50.910
Yeah

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:54.380
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.980
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:03.320
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:19.570
Wait!

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:25.660
Damn! It moves so fast!

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:26.760
Ketsu!

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:29.570
It tore off!

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:33.770
You suck.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:37.110
Hey! Stop stealing my prey!

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:40.010
Look carefully.
The part I got is longer.

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.750
That means it's my prey.

00:02:42.060 --> 00:02:45.320
Shut up! And get off my Kekkai!
Metsu!

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:47.320
Hey! Don't run away!

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:49.120
They're so energetic.

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:50.630
What are they doing?

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:08.040
Are you all right, Tokine?

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.210
Yeah. Gen-kun got it for me.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.550
Oh, your right shoulder.

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:16.850
It's not a problem.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.690
Come to think of it.
you always ruin your clothes.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.530
Are you fixing
your clothes yourself?

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:26.160
No. I have spares.
Over 20 of them.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:27.520
That many?!

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:29.400
You're quite fashionable!

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:30.530
What does that mean?

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:32.360
Never mind that.

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.000
Why don't you hurry
and clean this up?

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:37.800
Wait!

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.020
We're talking more

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.010
but he still refuses to
look me in the eye.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.170
Metsu!

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:49.180
Hey.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:52.490
Don't always make Tokine
do all the clean up.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:55.090
I can't use techniques like that.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:56.730
That's not what I meant.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.470
Your attitude is insulting
to Tokine.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.300
How she interprets my attitude
is her problem.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:03.940
It's not for you to say.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:05.670
What?! It's that attitude!

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:08.210
Go ahead and keep treating
Tokine like that.

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:09.810
and my super chop will...

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.840
Why are you always so concerned
with that girl?

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:16.010
Aren't the Sumimura and
Yukimura family rivals?

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.420
Sh-Shut up!

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:30.690
Wait!

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:33.190
Shut up! Don't follow me!

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:36.440
You made fun of
my beloved coffee milk!

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.410
I just said that you're drinking
too much of it!

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:41.780
No! You said, "How can you
keep drinking that stuff?"

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.540
What do you mean by "that stuff"?!

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:46.550
Okay fine! Now stop following me!

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:49.540
I don't want to be with you
during the day too!

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:52.250
She's completely rejecting me?!

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:55.050
You're in the way!
You're unpleasant! I hate you!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.350
Hey.

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:29.720
Aren't you concerned?

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:31.510
Do you want me to be concerned?

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:34.880
Yes...

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.620
Do you like that girl?

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.300
Who are you talking about?!

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.510
That Yukimura...

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:48.030
What "girl"?

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:51.100
I don't understand what you
like about that girl.

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:53.170
Don't call her "that girl"!

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:54.950
You said it first.

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:01.410
I just think that all women
are annoying.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:06.020
Wait, don't tell me you're
on "that side."

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:09.630
But I do think that women
smell better.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:13.800
What? Smell?
What a dirty piece of information!

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.200
W-What are you talking about?

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.370
My sense of smell is
sharper than normal.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.940
It can be a bit of
a pain sometimes.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:25.510
Hmm, then do you want to
try smelling my socks sometime?

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:26.500
Why would I?!

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:30.770
Tokine.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:33.090
- Let's go home.
- Sure.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:34.550
Wow! Is this really happening?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.160
Hi everyone.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:38.680
Do you mind letting me through?

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.700
Wow! Why is he here?!

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:45.500
Who's he?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.830
It's Hachioji Kimiya-kun!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:53.430
I found you.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:58.710
M-Me?

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.420
I couldn't take
my mind off of you

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:04.910
since the moment I saw you in town.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:06.950
Kimiya-sama...

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.050
Huh?

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.180
You...

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:16.650
Huh?

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:22.700
The fortune really came true!

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.740
I guess I'll take a nap when I get home.

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:29.980
Huh? You sleep all day
at school

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.140
and you're going to sleep
more at home?

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:34.950
What was that group
of girls?!

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.380
They looked like they were
out for blood!

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:38.910
He's really here?!

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:41.280
Yeah. He's at the high school campus.

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:42.610
What happened?

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:46.360
A really good-looking guy
is visiting the high school campus.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.020
Oh.

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:50.630
I expected more of
a reaction from you.

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:53.730
Yuri will only react if
it has to do with Sumimura-kun.

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:55.760
Oh really?!

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:00.270
I like handsome boys!

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:03.940
Let's hurry!

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:05.940
Did you hear?!

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:09.980
That Hachioji Kimiya is at
the high school campus.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:11.240
- Who's that?
- Who's that?

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:12.950
You don't know about him?

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:15.580
He's a sophomore at
Central East High School.

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:18.050
He's the most popular guy
around here.

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:19.760
According to my data,

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:21.530
the biggest reason that
he is popular is because...

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:23.020
of his cool gaze!

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:26.830
The second is his white teeth.
brighter than any celebrity's!

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:30.070
The third reason is his silky
smooth hair that flutters in the wind!

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:32.340
The fourth reason is...

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:33.500
That's enough!

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:36.030
I'm depressed enough as it is,
so don't make me listen to that.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.370
What? I have up to 108, though.

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:39.470
Seriously?!

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:43.750
He's nicknamed "The Prince."
and he's like the town idol.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:47.110
I wonder why he's here.
The mystery deepens.

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:51.490
I think you're exaggerating
when you call it a mystery.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:58.390
Look at that crowd.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:01.470
Here he comes.

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:07.530
Huh? Isn't that Yukimura Tokine?

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:09.110
The Prince of Central High and

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.870
the Nightingale
of the Heisei Era?

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:12.400
They make a good couple.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.580
What's going on?

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:22.390
Please don't go, Kimiya-sama!

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:24.320
The amazing Hachioji Kimiya.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:25.850
Oh well. Let's go home.

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:27.360
- No!
- Huh?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.480
Let's follow them!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:29.650
Sounds like an idea!

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:30.720
What?!

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:41.210
Still...

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:43.400
I never thought those two
would be dating.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.340
You don't know that yet!

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:47.770
They look like a couple though.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:50.180
No! I can say for sure
they're not!

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:52.180
Then what's their relationship?

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:53.710
They're... you know!

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:57.050
He's her long-lost brother!
Something like that!

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:58.280
That's impossible.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.960
Hey, those two disappeared
while you were quibbling.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.590
What?! Let's follow them!

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:04.100
No, I've had enough.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.190
Why?!

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.820
You're Yukimura Tokine's neighbor, right?

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:10.460
You can just ask her about it.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.440
I-I can't ask her about this!

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:13.430
Besides...

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:17.170
I'm going to kill that girl!

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:21.340
I'm too scared to run
into that crowd.

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:22.810
I'm going home.

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:24.580
- See ya!
- See ya!

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:25.640
Hey!

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:27.580
What should I do?

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:29.790
Anyway, where did they go?

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:37.890
Shishio?

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:39.760
Oh yeah he could...

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.380
I wanna ask you for a favor...

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:00.450
You said you had a good
sense of smell, right?

00:11:00.920 --> 00:11:03.520
Can you find someone
from their scent?

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:05.720
You don't have to ask me.
I'm already doing it.

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:07.250
You mean them, right?

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:08.420
Huh?

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:12.700
They're holding hands!

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:16.430
Are they really going out?
Are they on a date?!

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:20.210
Damn! I'm going to kill him!

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:21.800
Oh no...

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.230
Little by little...

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:24.370
Little by little...

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:27.210
They're going to
a more deserted area...

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:35.280
That movement...

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:38.120
He's holding her in his arms?!

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:41.390
We're flying high
on my wings of love!

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.630
I'll follow you to
the ends of the world!

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:47.460
How far are they
into their relationship?!

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:51.370
No one should be following us now.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:54.270
My fans can become
uncontrollable sometimes.

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:56.510
They'll follow me anywhere.

00:11:57.240 --> 00:12:02.440
They're tearing down this building,
so no one will come here.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:07.240
We're finally alone.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:09.450
Now let's begin.

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.450
They're going to kiss!

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:16.390
I hope you know this.
But if you don't listen to me...

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:20.360
...I will kill this man.

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.160
I know.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:24.510
I knew it!

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:28.530
Oh! Tokine! What do you like
about that pervert?!

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:31.910
I heightened this man's
physical abilities.

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:33.880
You better not try
anything stupid.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:38.080
I know. So why don't you hurry up
and show yourself.

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:57.940
What do you want?

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:02.070
I want... your body.

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:03.440
Her body?!

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:06.480
So he wants to change up
to a stronger body.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:10.880
Look what's on
that guy's shoulder.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:14.510
What?! That's an Ayakashi!

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:18.920
I'll give you my body.
But tell me one thing first.

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:20.180
What is it?

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:22.860
You targeted me because
you heard about

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:25.920
Karasumori and the Kekkaishi
from somebody, right?

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:28.630
Why do you want to know?

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.230
Come on.
That's what I want in trade.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:33.540
I'll do as you say, so tell me.

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:39.840
The Kokuboro.

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:43.180
The Koku... boro?

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:51.020
The Kokuboro are selling information
about you people and Karasumori.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:56.320
If we use that to find more leads.
they buy the information from us.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:14:02.070
After I take over your body,
I'll start looking through your memory!

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:05.300
I can also use your body to search
for information!

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:10.230
I can give your body
to them. too.

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.070
Who is involved in the Kokuboro?

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:16.010
That's enough.
Let's begin the transfer.

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:20.340
The process goes like this.

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:25.790
First you say my name.
Hachioji Kimiya, that is.

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:31.830
Then will you slowly and
accurately whisper your name...

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:36.460
into my ear with
all your heart?

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:39.870
That is how the deal
will be sealed.

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:43.100
Now hurry!

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:08.560
Hachioji Kimiya-kun.

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:19.910
Tell me one last thing.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.280
There are other Kekkaishi.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.910
Why did you come after me?

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:26.550
You don't know?

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:29.650
That's because
you're the weakest.

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.590
But rest assured.
after I take over your body,

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:37.260
I will bring your latent
powers to their full potential.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:44.140
Don't underestimate me.

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:45.390
Ketsu!

00:15:58.420 --> 00:15:59.510
Why you-!

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:02.710
Don't be so sure of yourself!

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:10.190
Are you almost done?

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:11.920
Ketsu!

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:16.490
Now then.

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:20.830
Can you tell me more
about the Kokuboro?

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.070
Ketsu!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:27.840
Hurry up and answer me!

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:31.810
W-Wait! Don't you care about
what happens to this human?!

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:38.320
But I don't know that man.

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:42.020
What?! Wait wait wait!
Isn't he famous?

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:44.400
All women should love this face, right?

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:45.390
Ketsu!

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:49.530
Too bad. I prefer taller men.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:52.370
You need to have your shoulders
this high at the very least.

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:56.970
- But...
- Ketsu!

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:58.770
Ketsu!

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:00.570
- She's ruthless.
- Ketsu!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:04.850
Tokine likes taller men
with shoulders to her eye level?!

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:07.610
And I'm the opposite right now!

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.350
She brought down two people
at the same time.

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:15.160
I-It can't be!

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:20.460
A powered-up human can't
react fast enough to her techniques?

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:23.330
You better answer
my questions soon.

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:27.370
I don't mind taking my time
with you though.

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:31.440
Fortunately, this place
is deserted.

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.740
A-All right!

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:36.670
I'll tell you,
so please stop.

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:41.420
They never spoke about themselves.

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:43.250
I don't know much
that will be useful.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:46.850
Spill it. I'll be the judge
of what's useful.

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:55.730
Rumor says that the Kokuboro
is the name of their home base.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:00.410
It's said to be like a black
multi-storied building, like a castle.

00:18:00.840 --> 00:18:01.830
Anything else?

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:07.310
I only saw one of them.
It felt like he was modified.

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:09.140
What do you mean?

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:11.710
Will you let me go
if I tell you?

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:13.480
That depends on what
you tell me.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:18.830
As you know, Ayakashi are
slaves to their desires

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:20.450
and are self-centered, right?

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:23.090
But the ones from the Kokuboro
are different.

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:26.170
They seem like a gathering
of halfwits and outcasts.

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:28.190
but they function well
as an organization.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:32.730
They have been altered
to work as a group?

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:35.240
I have no proof,

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:39.710
but their thought processes are closer
to humans than that of Ayakashi.

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:40.940
To humans?

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:42.080
Yes.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:46.310
Ayakashi have no interest in working
in groups or sourcing information.

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:50.490
But they do. Like humans, right?

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:51.880
True.

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:56.390
They're either modeling
themselves after humans. or...

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:58.130
Or what?

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:01.330
They're trying to compete against humans.

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:03.970
What do you think?

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:09.530
I can only say this because
I've seen inside the minds of humans.

00:19:12.780 --> 00:19:14.800
I've told you this much.

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:17.580
Isn't that enough?!

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:19.880
Ketsu!

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:22.280
Now I just need to sprint away!

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:28.500
STILL DEPRESSED

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.800
STILL DEPRESSED
How pitiful.

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:30.790
STILL DEPRESSED

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:40.360
Your host, Hachioji-kun is
knocked out cold.

00:19:40.670 --> 00:19:43.040
I wonder what you can do for me now?

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:45.940
Ugh... spare me...

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:50.820
You said that I was
the weakest in Karasumori.

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:52.780
You may be right.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:57.180
But you know,
I'm also the most merciless.

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:58.890
W-Wait...

00:19:58.890 --> 00:19:59.880
Metsu!

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:04.190
Ow...

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:07.420
What the-?!

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.230
Where am I?

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:12.230
I'm sorry!
Are you all right?!

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:15.130
Who are you?

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.810
U-Um...

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:19.600
Ketsu!

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.020
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:24.050
- I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
- Excuse me?

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.610
I'm sorry!

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.320
I'm sorry!

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:29.790
- Hachioji-kun?!
- I'm sorry!

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:33.890
How? He shouldn't remember

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:36.800
being possessed by
the Ayakashi. Huh?

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:40.400
What are you two doing there?!

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:46.230
I'm still growing.

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:49.740
So I will grow taller...
taller... taller...

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:51.480
I'm starting to get
a better idea

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:52.470
of who the enemy is.

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:55.340
Have you heard anything from
the Shadow Organization?

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:58.090
I'm just a grunt,

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:00.680
so I'm not told anything outside
of my current mission.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:05.030
I see. But if the Kokuboro
is trying to

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:09.500
use the power of Karasumori
to compete with humans,

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:12.020
this problem is bigger
than we can handle.

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:16.570
In fact. information
about Karasumori

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:18.730
is spreading to more Ayakashi.

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:21.040
We won't be able to
handle them all.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:24.240
I can't decide this on my own,

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:27.150
but I think we should cooperate
with the Shadow Organization more.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:30.640
My superiors... do have plans, probably.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:34.050
This is such a pain!

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:38.490
Just shut up and beat down
any Ayakashi that comes at us!

00:21:38.930 --> 00:21:40.790
Why are you mad?

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:42.320
Shut up!
I'm going home to sleep!

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:44.490
What's his problem?

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:47.090
Damn. Just you watch!

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:48.830
I'll sleep more and
grow even more!

00:21:51.570 --> 00:21:55.060
Do you really like
that scary girl?

00:21:55.610 --> 00:21:56.600
Shut up!

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:00.470
Chief.

00:22:01.010 --> 00:22:03.980
We found out the name
of the ones after Karasumori.

00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:08.320
Koku... boro?

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:11.150
Yeah. That's what
they call themselves.

00:22:11.460 --> 00:22:14.330
It doesn't matter. since I'll
just beat them all!

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:17.890
I see...

00:22:18.670 --> 00:22:21.290
Do you know about
the Kokuboro. Grandma?

00:22:21.940 --> 00:22:25.430
Kokuboro...
I've heard of that name before...

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:50.020
With a look on your face that says
"I'm doing this for you"

00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:53.290
While being enthusiastic
across the table

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:57.460
Why do you only tell me
dark predictions?

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:01.060
It's a meaningless
use of language.

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:04.870
Trying to avoid an emergency
nothing's gonna happen

00:23:05.010 --> 00:23:08.850
I can't learn anything
(What's going on?)

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:12.910
You're not bearing
the brunt of my future

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:16.180
I am it's common sense

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:20.520
I can't go anywhere
if I'm always weak

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:26.500
Train me so hard until I cry

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:32.830
If you're gonna complain that
tough times are heading our way

00:23:32.870 --> 00:23:34.810
(If that's true)

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:39.510
Please don't baby me
any more than you need to

00:23:39.650 --> 00:23:42.950
Please Please Please

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:47.150
Even if I bleed
I'll get a hold of the wisdom

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:50.490
To stand firm in
this unstable world

00:23:50.520 --> 00:23:54.760
You watch from far away

00:23:54.800 --> 00:24:00.760
It's strange that
I want to hold you

00:24:01.570 --> 00:24:02.870
Hey Hey
